{"2701070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Major\\Minor 2.0: (Re)Vision", "steam_appid": 2701070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Try our latest game while you wait!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701070/extras/f2efac3d5a76eeed7421debc1ed64e99.avif?t=1755791429\" width=600 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701070/extras/57c0c84f6b6143e5bf4f7c31999e138a.avif?t=1755791429\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious wave of serial murders have begun to hit Tokyo, with crime scenes defying explanation. As one of the &quot;Lucky Two&quot;, you've beaten the odds, and won a contest that grants you a luxurious spot in a pop idol's world tour; promising the adventure of a lifetime. With Tokyo as your first stop, however, events quickly escalate. You'll soon become an important figure in a struggle that spans multiple worlds, and their puzzling connection. You may not only be the key to solving these mysterious murders - but you may hold the fate of all existence in your hands as well. Enjoy your adventure, and choose wisely... <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701070/extras/f2a12fdf584a9cb1c03d8982d3ecbde4.avif?t=1755791429\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a re-imagining of the original visual novel released in 2016, and includes: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Completely Re-Written Script  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > New Dialogue Choices </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > New User Interface</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Quality of Life Upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As well as everything that people loved about the original! A dramatic story filled with twists and turns, multiple endings, and affection system where characters may treat you differently based on how you treat them, and either open up, or close off. Experience the beloved story, and the Ursa Major 2016 Game of the Year...</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701070/extras/f2efac3d5a76eeed7421debc1ed64e99.avif?t=1755791429\" width=600 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701070/extras/57c0c84f6b6143e5bf4f7c31999e138a.avif?t=1755791429\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious wave of serial murders have begun to hit Tokyo, with crime scenes defying explanation. As one of the &quot;Lucky Two&quot;, you've beaten the odds, and won a contest that grants you a luxurious spot in a pop idol's world tour; promising the adventure of a lifetime. With Tokyo as your first stop, however, events quickly escalate. You'll soon become an important figure in a struggle that spans multiple worlds, and their puzzling connection. You may not only be the key to solving these mysterious murders - but you may hold the fate of all existence in your hands as well. Enjoy your adventure, and choose wisely... <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701070/extras/f2a12fdf584a9cb1c03d8982d3ecbde4.avif?t=1755791429\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a re-imagining of the original visual novel released in 2016, and includes: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Completely Re-Written Script  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > New Dialogue Choices </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > New User Interface</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Quality of Life Upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As well as everything that people loved about the original! A dramatic story filled with twists and turns, multiple endings, and affection system where characters may treat you differently based on how you treat them, and either open up, or close off. Experience the beloved story, and the Ursa Major 2016 Game of the Year...</p>", "short_description": "Become intertwined in the fateful connection plaguing two worlds, bound together by a murder mystery, and a competition for the throne of a god. The award-winning visual novel, completely revamped! New script, new choices! Become The Savior today...", "supported_languages": "English", "reviews": "“Every character in Major\\Minor displays some form of moral ambiguity, and their overall complexity is what keeps them and their intertwining stories intriguing. (Review for the original 2016 Major\\Minor)”<br />\r\nRPGFan<br />\r\n<br />\r\n“Major\\Minor does the major parts right in a lot of clever and beautiful ways. The world is fantastic, the art is wonderful, and the plot is filled with twists and turns. (Review for the original 2016 Major\\Minor)”<br />\r\nCubed3<br />\r\n", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701070/header.jpg?t=1755791429", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701070/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755791429", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701070/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755791429", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong